# Testing patterns

- Mirror the source file name in `*.spec.ts`.
- Use `Test.createTestingModule()` for unit tests in `src/`.
- Use `supertest` only in `test/*e2e-spec.ts`.
- Keep assertions focused on exported behavior, not internals.